Strawberry filling. $20.00
Message on cake: "Congratulations on your retirement, Mary Ellen!". free
Special instructions: Decorate cake with yellow icing flowers. $15.00 
Delivery Fee. $15.00
Grand Total. $125.00', 'Bánh Oma Jean
